Cell["\<\
A non-binary network (an index shared by three or more tensors) is flagged \
with BinaryQ -> False. Path-finding by GreedyContractionPath or \
OptimalContractionPath operates on the binary form, so a non-binary network \
must first pass through BinaryTensorNetwork, which inserts copy tensors via \
SymbolicDeltaProductArray:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->329707495,ExpressionUUID->"dce87bf2-185a-42f0-8a13-6e395587edf7"],

